; local-helper.kurt
;
; small helper theory for 17-local.kurt, demonstrating what `load` does and doesn't
; make available. Not a lesson on its own -- but it's discovered and loaded like any
; other `.kurt` file, so it needs to work standalone too.

prop P
prop Q local       ; declared, but `local` -- the declaration stays inside this file

use P             "exported"        ; labelled -- travels to whoever loads this file
use Q local       "hidden"          ; labelled, but `local` -- stays inside this file
use P implies Q                     ; unlabelled -- also stays inside this file
